    "name": "Enigma Heart",
    "steam_appid": 2986980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/5b8603f06a1a58af60fbcf225b8ddfb8.poster.avif?t=1755221403\" width=626 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/5b8603f06a1a58af60fbcf225b8ddfb8.webm?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/5b8603f06a1a58af60fbcf225b8ddfb8.mp4?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysteries of your past and shape your destiny in <i>Enigma Heart,</i> a side-scrolling action RPG that blends classic gameplay with modern sensibilities. Explore a war-torn kingdom, master magic and combat, and unlock new abilities to help you navigate the land and uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Zalia, a wanderer who awakens in a seaside village with no memory of who she is or why she was attacked. Nursed back to health by the local innkeeper Esme, Zalia embarks on a perilous journey to reclaim her lost past, protect those who have shown her kindness, and stand against the dark forces threatening Lufain. With a richly woven story, dynamic battles, and a sapphic love story at its heart, <i>Enigma Heart</i> delivers a nostalgic yet fresh take on the action RPG genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/772e571a5a7995cf8b02cbade2ffca5a.poster.avif?t=1755221403\" width=626 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/772e571a5a7995cf8b02cbade2ffca5a.webm?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/772e571a5a7995cf8b02cbade2ffca5a.mp4?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant exploration across the kingdom of Lufain, with hidden secrets, upgrades, and optional treasures waiting for you to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable abilities that enhance both combat and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat system inspired by classic action RPGs, blending swordplay, magic, and strategic defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modes of transport that open up new areas and hidden locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling narrative with deep, character-driven storytelling, including a sapphic love story at the heart of the adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles and hidden tasks that reward players with unique upgrades and lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art with a colorful, 16-bit-inspired aesthetic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/b18c4f9e07f4dbc8527d740de3b7e1bf.poster.avif?t=1755221403\" width=626 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/b18c4f9e07f4dbc8527d740de3b7e1bf.webm?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/b18c4f9e07f4dbc8527d740de3b7e1bf.mp4?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/5b8603f06a1a58af60fbcf225b8ddfb8.poster.avif?t=1755221403\" width=626 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/5b8603f06a1a58af60fbcf225b8ddfb8.webm?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/5b8603f06a1a58af60fbcf225b8ddfb8.mp4?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysteries of your past and shape your destiny in <i>Enigma Heart,</i> a side-scrolling action RPG that blends classic gameplay with modern sensibilities. Explore a war-torn kingdom, master magic and combat, and unlock new abilities to help you navigate the land and uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Zalia, a wanderer who awakens in a seaside village with no memory of who she is or why she was attacked. Nursed back to health by the local innkeeper Esme, Zalia embarks on a perilous journey to reclaim her lost past, protect those who have shown her kindness, and stand against the dark forces threatening Lufain. With a richly woven story, dynamic battles, and a sapphic love story at its heart, <i>Enigma Heart</i> delivers a nostalgic yet fresh take on the action RPG genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/772e571a5a7995cf8b02cbade2ffca5a.poster.avif?t=1755221403\" width=626 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/772e571a5a7995cf8b02cbade2ffca5a.webm?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/772e571a5a7995cf8b02cbade2ffca5a.mp4?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant exploration across the kingdom of Lufain, with hidden secrets, upgrades, and optional treasures waiting for you to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable abilities that enhance both combat and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat system inspired by classic action RPGs, blending swordplay, magic, and strategic defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modes of transport that open up new areas and hidden locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling narrative with deep, character-driven storytelling, including a sapphic love story at the heart of the adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles and hidden tasks that reward players with unique upgrades and lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art with a colorful, 16-bit-inspired aesthetic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/b18c4f9e07f4dbc8527d740de3b7e1bf.poster.avif?t=1755221403\" width=626 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/b18c4f9e07f4dbc8527d740de3b7e1bf.webm?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986980/extras/b18c4f9e07f4dbc8527d740de3b7e1bf.mp4?t=1755221403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Unravel the mysteries of your past, protect the ones you love, and shape your destiny in Enigma Heart, a modern new take on a classic action RPG formula. Blend exploration, magic, and combat with a variety of new abilities as you stand against the dark forces threatening your homeland.",
